  chooseText: Selected the radio relay. If anything is still transmitting out here,
    this module should hear it. Maybe we can find help. Or find out who was calling
    us.
  completedText: "Radio relay recovered. I detected a repeating transmission beneath
    the static. It uses an old survey frequency\u2026 one that should have gone silent
    years ago."
  nextDayText: Weather looks cooperative and your legs are fully operational. Time
    to explore.
  showPortrait: 1
  descriptionText: A long-range communication module used to send and receive signals
    across vast distances. It is badly damaged, but it may still detect transmissions
    in the area.
